Package: phyloseqExplorer
Title: Interactive Exploration and Publication-Ready Analysis of Phyloseq Objects
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Nourelhouda", "Mathlouthi", , "nourhouda0810@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0000-0000-0000"))
Description: A Shiny application for microbiome and metabarcoding data stored as
    phyloseq objects. Provides sequence/QC overview, rarefaction, composition
    plots and tables (with per-clade ASV and read counts), alpha diversity with
    assumption-checked statistics, beta diversity (PCoA, dendrogram, biplot,
    PERMANOVA, betadisper, pairwise tests), constrained ordination (RDA) with
    collinearity and VIF guards plus taxon-environment correlations, taxonomy
    tables and regex group search. Figures export as SVG, PNG, PDF or TIFF and
    every tab exports Excel workbooks. Runs fully offline with any phyloseq object.
